{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.no_finite_colour_arena","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.no_finite_colour_arena","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L114-L126","doc":"**No finite colour arena.**  For every fixed colour dimension `N` and every\nshape `μ`, there is a partition of size `|μ| + (N+1)` that the colour-`ℂ^N`\narena misses; ranging `μ` over all partitions of `m = n-(N+1)` gives (via the\ninjection `missedEmbedding`) at least `p(n-N-1)` distinct missed blocks at\nsize `n` — unbounded in `A`.\n\nThis is the structural upgrade of \"no finite colour arena\" from the empirical\n`3.4% → 6.0%` data points to a block-count theorem: a finite `ℂ^N` cannot\ncapture the full-Hecke trace for all mass numbers `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedEmbedding_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedEmbedding_injective","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L106-L112","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedEmbedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedEmbedding","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L94-L104","doc":"**Block-count backbone.**  For every target size `m`, `appendUnitRows N`\nembeds the partitions of size `m` into the colour-`ℂ^N`-MISSED partitions of\nsize `m + (N+1)`.  Since `m` is arbitrary, the missed-block family is\nunbounded as the size (`∝ A`) grows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_injective","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L86-L92","doc":"`appendUnitRows N` is **injective**: distinct shapes give distinct images\n(strip the fixed `N+1` trailing unit rows). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_missed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_missed","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L78-L84","doc":"The appended unit rows give a partition the colour-`ℂ^N` arena **misses**\n(it has `≥ N+1 > N` rows). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_sum","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L74-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows_length","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L70-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.appendUnitRows","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L64-L68","doc":"**Append `N+1` unit rows**: `μ ↦ μ ++ (1^{N+1})`.  Extends the first column\ndownward by `N+1` boxes, so the row count jumps by `N+1`.  Canonical\n(weakly-decreasing) whenever `μ` is, since each part of `μ` is `≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missed_iff_not_captured","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missed_iff_not_captured","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L60-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedByColourArena","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.missedByColourArena","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L56-L58","doc":"A partition `λ` is **missed** by a finite colour-`ℂ^N` arena iff `rows(λ) > N`\n(its `N`-variable Schur specialization vanishes). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.capturedByColourArena","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColourArenaBlockCount.capturedByColourArena","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/ColourArenaBlockCount.lean#L51-L54","doc":"A partition `λ` is **captured** by a finite colour-`ℂ^N` arena iff its\n`N`-variable principal Schur specialization is nonzero, i.e. (Schur\nrow-bound) iff `rows(λ) ≤ N`.  Rows `= List.length`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}